{"title":"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Eight points are spaced around at intervals of one unit around a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/c/e4c044326e2e84b768dafef07060bd42b0a5cb21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> square, as shown. Two of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> points are chosen at random. What is the probability that the two points are one unit apart?\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/4/7b4e4d5204c427f5ab2b242c550558317658b12d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size((50)); dot((5,0)); dot((5,5)); dot((0,5)); dot((-5,5)); dot((-5,0)); dot((-5,-5)); dot((0,-5)); dot((5,-5)); [/asy]\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/4/cf45a08ec481826157b882858a61948504d0d747.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{4}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{2}{7}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{4}{11}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{4}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"376\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The two points are one unit apart at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> places around the edge of the square. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e29a0692410e17d9e19c741701e9489771c710e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\choose 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"22\" height=\"27\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/c/c6cb043da75a9fc05b05f07e15cd26ca2397adcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 28$\" width=\"36\" height=\"12\" /> ways to choose two points. The probability is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/8/2d8bb743056c3f8a324def77999d5c702eb2113a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{8}{28} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac27}\\]\" width=\"103\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Arbitrarily pick a point in the grid. Clearly, we see two options for the other point to be placed, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/7/8a70e7a3d395125d49488880065623ab24fdb182.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"58\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZVD_PZYjonQ\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZVD_PZYjonQ</a>   ~David\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/PeI8YSHCdlM\">https://youtu.be/PeI8YSHCdlM</a>  Soo, DRMS, NM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8\" title=\"2008 AMC 8\">2008 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2008\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/P